Local changes in this copy (all other files are byte-identical to the upstream commit):
- providers.ts: the onnxruntime module is loaded through setOrtLoader() instead of a
  non-literal dynamic import, so the browser build bundles onnxruntime-web. The app registers
  it in src/lib/laya.ts.
- providers.ts: the browser encoder session requests ["wasm"] only, not ["webgpu", "wasm"]. The
  0.8 threshold was calibrated on WASM output.
- common.ts: an unused parameter in buildQuestionPrefixUncached is renamed _maxLen.
- shortlist.ts: an unused callback parameter is renamed _s.

The upstream laya-ts/scripts/export_onnx.py is not vendored; scripts/export-laya.ps1 fetches it
from the same commit.
